    <node id="Cancer Centers">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Centers</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer centers are specialized medical facilities that provide comprehensive care and treatment for various types of cancer, including follicular lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer centers are specialized medical facilities that provide comprehensive treatment and support for cancer patients, including access to therapies and clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer centers are specialized medical institutions that focus on diagnosing and treating various forms of cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697db1653f51e966e79b92eefeb01ec6</data>
