      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Transformed FL refers to the condition where follicular lymphoma changes into a more aggressive type, such as diffuse large B-cell lymphoma (DLBCL).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1</data>
