    <node id="Mouth Cancer">
      <data key="d0">Mouth Cancer</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Mouth cancer, also known as oral cancer, is a type of cancer that affects the mouth and is categorized as a head and neck cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer, classified under head and neck cancers, develops in various parts of the mouth and is characterized primarily by squamous cell carcinoma (SCC).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f43f96815f23658d5b24fe95ed4bd5ed</data>
