    <node id="Cancer Research">
      <data key="d0">Cancer Research</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer Research refers to the systematic investigation into the causes, treatment, and prognosis of cancer, helping improve patient outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer research encompasses efforts to understand and combat conditions like prostate cancer, focusing on causes, risk factors, and potential treatments.</data>
