    <node id="Imaging Techniques">
      <data key="d0">Imaging Techniques</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Imaging techniques are methods such as MRI and ultrasound used to visualize internal body structures and assess conditions like prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging techniques such as CT, MRI, and PET scans are utilized to determine the extent and stage of cervical cancer before deciding on treatment options.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9a7fe3b15f3289198c7114b44890dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed</data>
