      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Pelvic lymph nodes are small structures located in the pelvis that are involved in filtering lymph fluid and can be affected by prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912</data>
    </node>
