      <data key="d0">Cancer Recurrence</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cancer recurrence refers to the return of breast cancer after treatment, which is influenced by tumor grade and other factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer recurrence refers to the return of cancer after treatment, indicating that cancer cells may still be present.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912</data>
