    </node>
    <node id="Urologist">
      <data key="d0">Urologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A urologist is a medical doctor specialized in diagnosing and treating urinary system diseases and male reproductive organ disorders.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist is a medical doctor specializing in the diagnosis and treatment of urinary tract disorders and conditions, including cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist is a medical doctor specializing in the urinary tract and male reproductive system, often involved in diagnosing and treating bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist is a medical doctor specializing in urinary system disorders and male reproductive health, often performing prostate biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist specializes in the urinary system and male reproductive organs and plays a critical role in diagnosing bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A urologist specializes in treating conditions related to the urinary system and male reproductive organs, playing a crucial role in bladder cancer diagnosis and treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a038845aaedb9ef7852018f26778b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a44e885faf856aa579d824b3cd85e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975e540ddee1810d43caf8df4adcf205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c0f6d26f2f58ca13201c1a90b0a180</data>
    </node>
