      <data key="d2">Lymphatic vessels transport lymph, which contains lymphocytes throughout the body, crucial for immune defense against infections and malignancies like Hodgkin lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphatic vessels transport lymph, which contains lymphocytes, throughout the body to enhance immune response.</data>
