    <edge source="Age" target="Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Age is a major risk factor for prostate cancer, especially for men over 65, linking age and disease incidence.&lt;SEP&gt;Age is a significant risk factor contributing to the likelihood of developing prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;There is a direct correlation between aging and the risk of developing prostate cancer, with incidence increasing in older men.</data>
