    <edge source="Radiologist" target="Imaging Tests">
      <data key="d4">55.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A radiologist interprets imaging tests and provides reports essential for diagnosing and managing cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists analyze and interpret results from various imaging tests to assist in identifying any issues, including cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists analyze imaging tests to inform diagnoses and recommend treatments based on their findings.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists are specialists who interpret imaging tests to help determine health conditions and plan treatments based on their findings.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists interpret imaging tests to provide accurate diagnoses and necessary follow-up.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists study imaging tests to diagnose conditions like prostate cancer, making their role pivotal in patient care.</data>
