      <data key="d5">Bone marrow is where lymphocytes are generated, which are essential for the body’s ability to combat Hodgkin lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow produces lymphocytes, essential for the immune response and their role in cancers like ALL.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow produces lymphocytes, which are essential in detecting and fighting Hodgkin lymphoma.</data>
