      <data key="d5">Kidney cancer can metastasize, indicating a serious progression of the disease that affects the organ's function.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney cancer exhibits a tendency to metastasize, leading to complications that affect kidney function and overall health.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease impact, organ function&lt;SEP&gt;disease progression, organ involvement</data>
