    </edge>
    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Advanced-stage Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Metastasis is a key characteristic of advanced-stage prostate cancer, indicating spread beyond the prostate.</data>
