    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Primary Tumor">
      <data key="d4">19.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Metastasis is the process by which cells from a Primary Tumor migrate to other regions in the body, forming new tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary tumor is the source from which metastasis can occur, influencing the cancer's overall stage and treatment approach.</data>
