    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="BRCA Genes">
      <data key="d4">28.0</data>
      <data key="d5">BRCA gene mutations significantly increase the risk of developing ovarian cancer, indicating a hereditary link.&lt;SEP&gt;Mutations in BRCA genes are a significant risk factor for developing ovarian cancer, necessitating Genetic Testing for affected individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Mutations in BRCA genes are linked to a greater risk of developing ovarian cancer, highlighting the importance of genetic testing for diagnosis and treatment planning.</data>
