    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">42.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a primary treatment modality for ovarian cancer, formulated to shrink tumors and eradicate cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a recommended treatment for ovarian cancer, especially for stages 2 to 4 post-surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a standard treatment method for ovarian cancer, utilized to target and kill cancer cells in the ovaries.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is frequently used as a treatment method for ovarian cancer to reduce or eliminate cancerous cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is often used as a treatment for ovarian cancer to eliminate remaining cancer cells post-surgery.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer treatment, adjuvant therapy&lt;SEP&gt;treatment approach, management&lt;SEP&gt;treatment method, cancer focus&lt;SEP&gt;treatment method, cancer type&lt;SEP&gt;treatment modality, cancer management</data>
