      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The cervix is part of the female reproductive system and connects the uterus to the vagina, indicating their anatomical relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;The cervix is the lower section of the uterus, vital for childbirth and regulation during the menstrual cycle.</data>
