    <edge source="Rucaparib" target="Maintenance Therapy">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Rucaparib is utilized as a maintenance therapy option for patients with HRD-positive cancers, particularly those with BRCA mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;Rucaparib serves as a recommended maintenance therapy for patients with HRD-positive ovarian cancers, enhancing treatment outcomes.</data>
