    <edge source="CT Scan" target="Cancer">
      <data key="d4">44.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A CT scan helps in diagnosing cancer by providing detailed images that can show abnormalities in various body parts.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans are crucial in diagnosing cancer by providing detailed images of potential tumor sites in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans are employed to detect and monitor cancerous growths by providing detailed images of the body's internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans are utilized to diagnose and monitor the presence of cancer in patients.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans can help in the detection and monitoring of cancer by providing detailed images of the inside of the body.</data>
      <data key="d6">diagnosis, imaging&lt;SEP&gt;diagnosis, imaging technique&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic imaging, cancer detection&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic tool, cancer detection</data>
